direction: right
title: Photon Vectorized Query Engine Architecture

Query: User Query (PySpark / Spark SQL)
Catalyst: Catalyst Logical Optimizer (JVM)
Decision: Is Photon Engine Enabled? {
  shape: diamond
  style.stroke: "#FBBF24"
}

Query -> Catalyst -> Decision

Classic: Classic JVM Spark (Project Tungsten) {
  style.stroke: "#64748B"
  CodeGen: Whole-Stage CodeGen via Janino
  JVM: JIT compiled loops in Java
  Limits: JVM JIT cannot reliably auto-vectorize; UTF-16 strings
}

Photon: Photon Engine (Native C++ SIMD) {
  style.stroke: "#34D399"
  SIMD: Explicit SIMD (AVX-512) vectorized batch instructions
  Memory: 100% Off-heap memory (Zero JVM GC overhead)
  Strings: Native UTF-8 string processing & bitmask null flags
}

Decision -> Classic: No (Fallback to JVM) { style.stroke: "#64748B" }
Decision -> Photon: Yes (Photon native execution) { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
